{
  "id": 8834757296327,
  "title": "Custom Football Player with American Flag Background Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-football-player-with-american-flag-background-comforter-44d8108598-44d8108598",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate football sanctuary with this custom football bedding set from Jeminise. Perfect for players, coaches, and dedicated fans, this set brings the spirit and passion of the game right into your personal space. Designed with a striking American football player silhouette against a patriotic flag backdrop, it adds an instant sporty touch to any kids' room, teen bedroom, or guestroom.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with your chosen name and player number for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester microfiber fabric with a soft, whole-piece filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for various beds, including Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover designed for inserts or a thicker, cozy comforter for all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry low or air dry without heat to keep the fabric fluffy and vibrant.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Set:</strong> Each package contains one main bedding cover (duvet or comforter) with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Football Player Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>American Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
